[en.IDEA_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK]
Advanced Magic Crash Course

[en.IDEA_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK_desc]
With the rise of modern magic theory, the School for Gifted Unicorns has decided to open a special magic education crash course, using new textbooks based on modern magic theory.

[zh.IDEA_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK]
先进魔法速成班

[zh.IDEA_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK_desc]
随着近代魔法理论的兴起，天才独角兽学院决定开设特别的魔法教育速成班，使用新的基于近代魔法理论的教科书。
